  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The grating spacing of a diffraction grating is 3 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu\"></span>m. When it is illuminated with a parallel beam of monochromatic light, the angle between the zero order and the third order is 30<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span>. </p>\n<p>Given that sin(30<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span>) = 0.5, what is the wavelength of the light?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">700 nm</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">600 nm</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">500 nm</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">400 nm</li>\n</ol>"
  },
